&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp&#39;s Point of Sale (POS) solution helps cafes, shops, bars, hair salons, and thousands of other businesses manage their day-to-day operations. Alongside the POS experience, merchants rely on powerful reporting, sales management, and fiscalisation tools to understand their business, stay compliant, and operate with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role would own these three domains from a design perspective - Reporting, Sales, and Fiscalisation. You&#39;ll design the experiences merchants use to analyse performance, manage sales activity, and navigate local fiscal requirements, while helping shape a more unified reporting experience across SumUp&#39;s payments, banking, and commerce products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work closely with product managers, engineers, and data teams within POS, and collaborate with designers and stakeholders across SumUp to deliver experiences that are clear, trustworthy, and built to scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎬 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9DG64C3moeQ&quot;&gt;Take a look at our Berlin office&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end design across Reporting, Fiscalisation, and Sales domains - from discovery and strategy through to production-ready delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the unification of reporting experiences across Dashboard and Mobile, making complex data clear and accessible for merchants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design holistic flows - including sign-up, onboarding, and export experiences, that meet local regulatory requirements while remaining scalable globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish UX patterns for presenting data-heavy, financial information consistently across SumUp products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape long-term product strategy by running discovery initiatives, influencing the roadmap, and acting as a trusted design partner for product and engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if…&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a minimum of 5 years working as a Product Designer, with a portfolio that demonstrates end-to-end ownership across complex digital products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have solid experience designing dashboards, reporting interfaces, or analytics products, with a clear ability to make complex financial or operational data understandable for non-expert users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have deep expertise in product&amp;nbsp; design, information architecture, and systems thinking, applied across interconnected product ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a track record of leading product discovery independently - from identifying user problems through to validating and shipping solutions, without needing close supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are an excellent communicator, comfortable aligning diverse stakeholders across product, engineering, and business functions and presenting work with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in Figma, with familiarity in Miro and Notion and comfort working within modern, collaborative design workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏙 Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About SumUp&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 38 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a ----- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Superchat, we&#39;re rebuilding how businesses talk to their customers. The phone call, the contact form, the support ticket: all of it is being replaced by messaging and AI. We&#39;re building the platform that runs underneath.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2020, Superchat has become the platform of choice for &lt;strong&gt;10,000+ businesses worldwide&lt;/strong&gt;, from globally recognized brands like Allianz, Auto1, Enpal, Danone, and GASAG to the small businesses, dental practices, and one-person startups that need to look bigger than they are. Today, &lt;strong&gt;millions of messages flow through Superchat every single day&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We started as a unified inbox: one place for every channel a customer might pick, WhatsApp, email, SMS, Instagram. Then ChatGPT happened, and the second chapter began: AI agents that respond across chat, email, and voice at the quality of the best human teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re &lt;strong&gt;100 people&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;profitable&lt;/strong&gt;, and have raised &lt;strong&gt;€18M in funding&lt;/strong&gt; (last round 4.5 years ago, we&#39;ve been growing on our own money since). Headquartered in Berlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As a Senior Revenue Operations Engineeer you anchor the build end of Revenue Operations - our internal product team whose customers are the GTM functions: Sales, CS, Marketing, and Finance. You build the AI, automation, and data foundations that make these teams faster, smarter, and more scalable, owning the end-to-end delivery of internal tools, integrations, and AI-powered workflows - from problem framing and architecture through launch, adoption, and measurable business impact.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Want&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven GTM Systems Builder.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring 3+ years of hands-on experience in RevOps, GTM Engineering, SalesOps, Business Systems, or a comparable B2B SaaS role, and can show production systems you personally built.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Native Builder.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ve integrated LLMs into real workflows or tools through APIs and understand how to move beyond prompting into reliable, production-ready use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-Minded Systems Thinker.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You start with the user and business problem, map the relevant process and data dependencies, and choose the simplest scalable solution rather than defaulting to a particular tool.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration &amp;amp; Data Fluent.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re comfortable working with APIs, webhooks, JSON, authentication, data models, and the movement of data between multiple systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Owner.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can take a project from discovery and architecture through building, testing, rollout, documentation, monitoring, and ongoing improvement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatic Production Engineer.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You ship quickly without treating reliability as optional, including appropriate testing, error handling, security, observability, and documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business-Impact Oriented.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You connect technical work to measurable outcomes such as pipeline, productivity, data quality, speed, cost, or customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear Cross-Functional Communicator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can explain technical decisions simply, manage trade-offs, work through ambiguity, and collaborate effectively with both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are fluent in written and spoken English; German is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious &amp;amp; Self-Directed.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You actively experiment with new technologies, learn through building, and share useful findings without chasing novelty for its own sake.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Who We Don’t Want&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Surface-Level Operator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ve used CRM and AI tools but lack hands-on experience building automations, configuring systems, or solving operational problems end-to-end.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Limited Business Acumen.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You struggle to understand cross-functional GTM processes and how operational decisions impact the wider business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weak Systems &amp;amp; Data Foundations.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You struggle with APIs, JSON, data models, authentication, debugging, or moving data reliably between systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weak Business Communicator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You cannot explain technical choices clearly, manage trade-offs, influence stakeholders, or connect a build to its wider business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Chat-Only AI Experience.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You use ChatGPT or Claude but cannot show an LLM-powered workflow, integration, or tool you&#39;ve personally built and shipped.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One-Off Hacker.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You build isolated automations without considering maintainability, documentation, ownership, failure handling, or how the solution fits into the wider architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Your Day To Day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building: AI, Automation &amp;amp; Systems (ca. 65%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You identify and productionize high-leverage AI use cases across Sales, Customer Success, Marketing, and Finance, including LLM integrations, workflow design, evaluation, guardrails, and monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You design and build lightweight internal applications and interfaces that remove recurring manual work, improve decision-making, and are simple for teams to adopt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build end-to-end workflows using Make, n8n, and custom logic, including business rules, system handoffs, error handling, alerts, and ongoing monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You create clean, maintainable data flows between HubSpot, the data warehouse, billing, support, and other GTM tools using APIs, webhooks, enrichment pipelines, and data activation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work deeply within HubSpot&#39;s objects, properties, workflows, and integration layer to support complex use cases without creating fragile or unnecessarily complicated architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Solution Design (ca. 15%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You translate scoped or ambiguous business problems into clear technical solutions, define success metrics, and choose the simplest approach that can deliver meaningful impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deployment, Adoption &amp;amp; Documentation (ca. 20%)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You test, document, deploy, and iterate on solutions with end users so they remain secure, maintainable, reliable, and useful after launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RevOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Your peers and manager to collaborate on projects and daily initiatives&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering team:&lt;/strong&gt; Coordinate with engineers for projects that may require product know how and integration across the engineering tool stack GTM teams as and when required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Why People Choose Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We believe in the power of in-person collaboration: You&#39;ll work with your team from our Berlin office at least three days a week. Some of the best ideas happen when we&#39;re in the same room - decisions are made faster, we learn from each other, and we grow stronger as a team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&#39;re an international team with diverse cultural backgrounds and languages. Openness, mutual respect, and the exchange of different perspectives shape the way we work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We value ambition and drive. We&#39;re looking for people who take ownership, show initiative, and are excited to grow quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We work with a high degree of ownership and a strong learning mindset. Asking questions, staying curious, and continuously improving are part of our everyday culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We care deeply about humility and teamwork. No egos, open feedback, and a willingness to learn from one another matter more to us than titles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose between an Urban Sports Club or John Reed membership, or a public transport pass/Dance subscription.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company-wide and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An annual €500 learning and development budget that you can use for conferences, courses, books, career coaching, and more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive and exciting startup culture that supports rapid professional and personal growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A beautiful office in the heart of Berlin (Prenzlauer Allee 242) with free snacks, drinks, and top-notch equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want to build a community, not just a company.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Creating an environment where people genuinely enjoy spending time together is important to us - whether that&#39;s through HYROX training, golf, beer pong tournaments, running clubs, Warhammer, weekend activities, or any other community you&#39;d like to build here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe that diversity makes companies stronger. We welcome applications from everyone, regardless of gender, background, nationality, or religion. Feel free to apply - we&#39;d love to hear from you!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our Privacy Policy.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We look forward to receiving your application! 🙂&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://i.imgur.com/Uicf3C7.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;800&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services and hosting services, you will work together with a wide range of teams. We are characterized by open structures, a friendly working culture and flat hierarchies with a strong team spirit. We firmly believe that work and fun are compatible, and offer you the right environment for this. Our constant growth means that we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At IONOS, you will collaborate with different teams as part of the leading European provider of cloud infrastructure, cloud services, and hosting services. We offer you a perspective in one of the most future-proof industries. We are characterized by open work structures, a first-name culture, and flat hierarchies with an unparalleled team spirit. We firmly believe that job and fun are compatible and provide the right environment for it. With constant growth, we are always looking for new colleagues. Become part of IONOS and let&#39;s grow together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Manager DC Software Development, you are responsible for leading and coordinating our software development team in Karlsruhe, which specializes in the purchase, development, and optimization of software solutions for our data center and bare metal teams. You will play a key role in shaping our technology roadmap and ensuring that our software infrastructure supports our teams&#39; work in the best possible way while meeting the highest standards for performance, scalability, and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Tasks&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership and Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead, motivate, and develop a team of highly skilled software developers and system engineers. Foster a culture of innovation, collaboration, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop the strategic direction of data center &amp;amp; bare metal software development in collaboration with your product owners and other stakeholders. Identify and integrate new technologies and trends into our solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the entire software development cycle from requirements analysis through design, implementation, testing to deployment and maintenance. Ensure adherence to schedules and budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Ensure the technical quality and architecture of our software solutions. Make informed decisions regarding design principles, coding standards, and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with data center and bare metal operations and other relevant teams to ensure seamless integration and smooth operation of our data center applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze and optimize the performance of our software to continuously improve the efficiency and reliability of the data centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Identify and mitigate potential risks of our applications and during the implementation or introduction of new solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Degree in Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, or comparable qualification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Several years of experience in a leadership position in software development, ideally in a data center or similarly technically complex environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Profound knowledge of modern software development methods (e.g., Agile, Scrum) and programming languages (e.g., Python, Ruby on Rails).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong affinity for current AI trends and their practical application to optimize business processes and create innovative products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud and DC Technologies:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive understanding of cloud architectures, virtualization, containers (Docker, Kubernetes), and infrastructure-as-code principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Network Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Basic understanding of network architecture and firewall configurations is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in designing scalable, highly available, and robust software systems for data centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication and presentation skills in German and English, both written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem-Solving Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong analytical skills and a solution-oriented working style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Ability:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to work effectively in a dynamic, interdisciplinary team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Benefits&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours through trust-based working hours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At some locations a subsidized canteen and various free drinks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modern office space with very good transport connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various employee discounts for activities and products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee events such as summer and winter parties, as well as workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numerous training and development opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Various health offers, such as sports and health courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;About IONOS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;IONOS is the leading European digitalization partner for small and medium-sized businesses (SMB). The company serves around six million customers and operates across 18 markets in Europe and North America, with its services being accessible worldwide. With its Web Presence &amp;amp; Productivity portfolio, IONOS acts as a &#39;one-stop shop&#39; for all digitalization needs: from domains and web hosting to classic website builders and do-it-yourself solutions, from e-commerce to online marketing tools. In addition, the company offers Cloud Solutions to enterprises who are looking to move to the cloud as their businesses evolve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;content-paragraph&quot;&gt;We value diversity and welcome all applications - regardless of,&amp;nbsp;for example, gender, nationality, ethnic&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;social origin, religion, disability, age as well as sexual orientation and identity, physical characteristics, marital status or any other irrelevant factor subject to applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Nebius Managed Kubernetes (mk8s) mission is to grow the Nebius cloud platform by providing a Kubernetes-native way to run AI systems with high efficiency and low operational overhead. &lt;br&gt;With a single click, it provides a Kubernetes cluster on top of Nebius services for compute (VMs) and networking. &lt;br&gt;In 2026, the service is scaling 10× and is expected to manage customer workloads across tens of thousands of GPU servers in more than 10 data centers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the mk8s Core team, one of three mk8s teams. The Core team owns the API, the core of the service control plane, cluster autoscaling, platform integrations, and running k8s add-ons.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Nebius, team leads are hands-on. We expect you to be a senior or staff engineer now (or earlier in your career). You will start as an individual contributor to gain context, then take on managerial responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you will be responsible to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead by example.&lt;/strong&gt; Set the quality bar by spending a significant portion of your time on IC work: writing and reviewing code, leading projects, and participating in on-call rotation, incident mitigation, and post-incident analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage 4–8 mid-to-senior engineers.&lt;/strong&gt; Provide context, coach, and give regular feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain the technical vision&lt;/strong&gt; for your area of responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with the Product Manager and Service Owner&lt;/strong&gt; to shape product vision and plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Examples of outcomes you could drive as a Team Lead&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize the service control plane to create and manage 20K GPU nodes in a single Kubernetes cluster, enabling a major contract for the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate cluster autoscaling approaches (e.g., Karpenter) to improve resource utilization and support seamless auto-upgrades.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide a Kubernetes-native way to use local disks to reduce disk I/O bottlenecks for AI training and inference, improving efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver managed Layer 7 load balancers to reduce operational overhead for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring to the table:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of professional software engineering or management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of Golang, or you are ready to quickly switch to this programming language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-month technical projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech leading engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning multi-month technical projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;It would be an added bonus if you had:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Team management, Kubernetes administration, Developing Kubernetes controllers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
